        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Does the sky have "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "weight",
            "ref": "v-weight"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "? Yes! In fact, it’s much heavier than you might think."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The sky is made of air. Air is all around us. It starts at the ground, and goes up, up, up to the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "top",
            "ref": "v-top"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of the sky. Air is not empty. It is made of air "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "molecules",
            "zh": "分子"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Guess what? Those molecules all have weight!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "What does all that air "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "add up to",
            "zh": "总计达"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "? The entire "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "atmosphere",
            "zh": "大气层"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " weighs around 5 million billion "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "tons",
            "zh": "吨"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It’s about the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "same",
            "ref": "v-same"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " weight as 570,000,000,000,000 (570 trillion) "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "adult",
            "ref": "v-adult"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Indian",
            "zh": "印度的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " elephants!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "If all that air was just on top of our heads, it might knock us down to the ground. But luckily, that weight spreads out "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "evenly",
            "zh": "均匀地"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " all over the Earth. And air moves around easily, so it "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "presses",
            "zh": "施加压力"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on all "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "sides",
            "ref": "v-side"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of us."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "You may not always feel air molecules pressing down on you, but they’re there!"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
